    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Rams\u00e8s, trente-cinq ans, tient un cabinet de voyance \u00e0 la Goutte d\u2019or \u00e0 Paris. Habile manipulateur et un peu po\u00e8te sur les bords, il a mis sur pied un solide commerce de la consolation. L\u2019arriv\u00e9e d\u2019enfants venus des rues de Tanger, aussi dangereux qu\u2019insaisissables, vient perturber l\u2019\u00e9quilibre de son commerce et de tout le quartier. Jusqu\u2019au jour o\u00f9 Rams\u00e8s va avoir une r\u00e9elle vision.",
        "english": "In the multicultural Parisian district of La Goutte d\u2019Or, Ramses makes a living as a clairvoyant, scamming his clients into believing he can contact the dead. As he gets caught up with a gang of young and fearless boys who terrorize the locals, Ramses makes a troubling and tragic discovery on a construction site. Could there be some truth behind his fraudulent mysticism ? Getting carried away on a fateful night, Ramses will come to develop a special bound with the street kids and confront the ghosts of his own childhood."
